This folder contains development and assembly images for the star tracker project.

Included images show:
- The completed mechanical structure
- Close-up views of the rotating turntable system
- Breadboard testing and temporary electronics setups
- The soldered circuit/perfboard assembly
- ESP32 testing and power verification
- Conceptual diagrams for the altitude rotation system

These images are intended to document the prototyping and construction process rather than serve as formal assembly instructions.
